{
  "bodyHash": "40f0978a16c948ec",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Simple Weapons 引入 8 種新武器，設計上力求與原版風格融合。每種武器都有獨特的玩法，旨在為玩家提供全新的體驗。&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組以 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a> 為核心進行平衡調整，但也可獨立使用。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>武器</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鐮刀：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KeikcPj.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">傷害：中等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：慢</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊範圍：極高&nbsp; *Better Combat 數值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*造成流血效果，隨時間持續造成伤害，更高階的武器會延長流血時間</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>巨劍：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JBhp5oz.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">傷害：高</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：慢</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊範圍：高&nbsp; *Better Combat 數值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*壓制：每第 3 次攻擊造成額外傷害</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>長矛：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/idYcdKW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">傷害：極高</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：極慢</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊範圍：極高&nbsp; *Better Combat 數值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*騎乘：騎乘時增加傷害</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>匕首：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iJuHMWb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">傷害：極低</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：極快</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊範圍：極低&nbsp; *Better Combat 數值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*背刺：增加傷害並使未察覺的目標失衡</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*造成的擊退較少</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>拳刺：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BKEh0SD.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">傷害：中高</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：中慢</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊範圍：極低&nbsp; *Better Combat 數值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*具備生命偷取效果，恢復量取決於命中敵人數量而非造成的傷害</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>彎刀：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/h0b8SbV.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">傷害：中低</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：中快</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊範圍：中等 * Better Combat 數值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*復仇：根據已損失生命值增加傷害，更高階的武器增幅更大</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*鋒利附魔不與復仇疊加，系統將自動套用傷害較高的效果</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>撬棍：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uGLy9gl.png\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">傷害：中等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：中等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊範圍：中等 * Better Combat 數值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*殘疾：造成 1 秒緩速效果</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*穿甲：對穿戴護甲的目標造成額外傷害</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>武士刀：</strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EIipFON.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">傷害：中等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊速度：中等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊範圍：中等 * Better Combat 數值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*鬥志：每次命中增加攻擊速度</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>開發中武器：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>*這些武器可能不會加入模組，內容尚未最終確定</em></span></p>\n<br>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>爪刃</strong> - 傷害低，命中實體可獲得暫時性加速效果（可疊加），&nbsp;反覆命中同一目標會造成流血</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">單手武器</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>戰斧&nbsp;</strong>- 傷害中高，攻擊可穿透盾牌，受到傷害時會提升自身傷害，擊殺實體也會增加傷害</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;所有效果皆可能調整，若有任何建議或想法歡迎告訴我！</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>相容性</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a> - 所有武器均採用該模組新增的動畫與數值</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/random-crits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Random Crits</a> - 安裝此模組後，彎刀與匕首觸發暴擊的機率會提高</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-corinthium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Corinthium</a> - 為所有武器新增科林斯金屬版本</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ogfTkBm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oreganized\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oreganized</a> - 為所有武器新增電合金版本</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4O10gxV.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"78\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a> - 為所有武器新增彭多鎳版本</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A5IQZFJ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"78\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deeper and Darker</a> - 為所有武器新增監守者版本</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CedGhpK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"78\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enlightened-end\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enlightened End</a> - 為所有武器新增金剛石版本 *已過時</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/71G15Z0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"78\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twilight Forest</a> - 為所有武器新增鐵木、鋼葉、騎士金屬與烈焰版本</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5ZCCQS5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3zlCG7a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A2ERkx9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/y5gLbdA.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>待辦相容清單：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我計劃為所有新增工具套件的熱門模組加入相容性。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>目前待辦清單：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Stalwart Dungeons</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Blue Skies</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Aquaculture 2</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Buddy Cards&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Upgraded Netherite</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forbidden and Arcanus</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Majrusz's Progressive Difficulty</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">LieonLion's Enderite</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Plus the End</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Create Addons (Alloyed,&nbsp;Stuff &amp; Additions)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Enderite Mod</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Copper Armor &amp; Tools</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Spirit</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">End's Phantasm</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Frosted Friends</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Additional Additions</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ice and Fire</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Aether</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若您希望我加入相容性但清單上沒有該模組，請隨時告訴我。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>常見問題</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>您會更新到最新版本嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 會，但更新需要時間，我會抽空進行。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>您會降級到 X 版本嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 不會，1.18.2 是最低支援版本。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Fabric 版？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 沒有原生 Fabric 版，但應可透過 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sinytra-connector\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sinytra Connector</a> 運作。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>您會新增 X 武器嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 不會。爪刃與戰斧是我目前唯一計畫新增的武器。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>您會新增與 X 模組的相容性嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 很有可能會，但請不要期望能很快完成。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>您能讓我們修改武器的數值嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p>- <span style=\"font-size:14px\">能力可透過設定檔關閉，其餘所有數值皆可借助 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/property-modifier\" rel=\"nofollow\">Property Modifier</a> 進行修改。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>沒有 Better Combat 也能運作嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 可以，但可能會導致遊戲不平衡。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>我可以將其用於自訂模組包中嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 可以。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>探索我的其他模組：</strong></span></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/random-crits\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DZXdDbg.png\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-enchantments\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/d1vkzqv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/difficult-spawners\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c7OCwgw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/revised-phantoms\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DPgZLAI.png\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\"></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252finfernaleclipse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2zXV5hA.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"184\" height=\"40\"></a></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
